{
  "date": "2026-11-28",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "央行发布新的存贷款利率规定，明年3月开始执行",
  "title_en": "The central bank issues new rules on deposit and loan interest rates, taking effect next March",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "11月27日，中国人民银行公布了一份新规定，内容是怎样管理人民币存款和贷款的利率。这份规定一共有31条，从2027年3月21日起开始执行，到时候旧的规定就不再使用了。",
      "en": "On November 27, the People's Bank of China published a new set of regulations on how interest rates for RMB deposits and loans are managed. The regulations have 31 articles in total and will take effect from March 21, 2027; at that time, the old rules will no longer be used."
    },
    {
      "zh": "新规定改变了贷款罚息的规则。罚息是借款人没有按时还钱时要多付的利息。以前，罚息的利率有固定的范围；以后，银行和借款人可以自己商量罚息利率、计算方法和宽限期，但是要符合央行的规定。",
      "en": "The new regulations change the rules on penalty interest for loans. Penalty interest is the extra interest a borrower must pay when they don't repay on time. In the past, the penalty interest rate had a fixed range; from now on, banks and borrowers can agree among themselves on the penalty rate, the calculation method and the grace period, but they must follow the central bank's rules."
    },
    {
      "zh": "新规定还写清楚了，银行不能用高息揽储这种不正当的方法吸收存款。例如，银行不能偷偷给客户额外的利息，也不能把存款和贷款连在一起。",
      "en": "The new regulations also make it clear that banks may not use improper methods such as attracting deposits with high interest. For example, banks may not secretly give customers extra interest, and they may not tie deposits and loans together."
    },
    {
      "zh": "另外，新规定说，存款和贷款的利率由金融机构自己决定。把日利率换成年利率时，要乘以365。央行在同一天还发布了一份关于大额存单的新办法。",
      "en": "In addition, the new regulations say that deposit and loan interest rates are decided by financial institutions themselves. When turning a daily interest rate into an annual rate, you multiply by 365. On the same day, the central bank also issued new measures on large-denomination certificates of deposit."
    }
  ],
